# Context for daemon/Dockerfile (built from the repository root): only what the
# daemon and its terminal engine's library build read. The engine's build runs
# scripts/verify-libghostty.sh --contract, which also checks the client files
# that link libghostty-vt and package its notice.
*
!daemon
!scripts
!native/terminal-vt/native.lock.json
!native/terminal-vt/NOTICE.Ghostty
!client/android/app/build.gradle.kts
!client/android/app/CMakeLists.txt
!client/ios/project.yml
!client/ui/more/settings/licenses/texts/Ghostty-MIT.txt
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
daemon/tmp
daemon/ghostty-libs
**/node_modules
**/.cache
